# A delegate holding t and e can remove messages
C: a0 CREATE moved
S: a0 OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] CREATE completed.

C: a1 SELECT #user.boby.sharedMailbox
S: \* OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] Ok
S: \* FLAGS \(.*\)
S: \* 10 EXISTS
S: \* \d+ RECENT
S: \* OK \[UIDVALIDITY \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[UNSEEN 1\].*
S: \* OK \[PERMANENTFLAGS .*\].*
S: \* OK \[HIGHESTMODSEQ \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[UIDNEXT 11\].*
S: a1 OK \[READ-WRITE\] SELECT completed.

C: a2 STORE 1 +FLAGS (\Deleted)
S: \* 1 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\\Deleted \\Recent\)\)
S: a2 OK STORE completed.

C: a3 EXPUNGE
S: \* 1 EXPUNGE
S: \* 9 RECENT
S: a3 OK EXPUNGE completed.

C: a4 UID MOVE 2 moved
S: \* OK \[COPYUID \d+ 2 1\] Moved UIDs.
S: \* 1 EXPUNGE
S: \* 8 RECENT
S: a4 OK MOVE completed.

C: a5 UID SEARCH ALL
S: \* SEARCH 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 10
S: a5 OK SEARCH completed.
